/.cargo/config.toml
heaptrack.*

# === Standard exclusions (do not depend on user ~/.gitignore) ===

# Rust build artifacts
target/

# Fuzz build artifacts and crashes
fuzz/target/
fuzz/artifacts/

# Profiling
perf.data
perf.data.old
flamegraph.svg
heaptrack.*.zst
cachegrind.out.*
callgrind.out.*
massif.out.*

# C/C++ build artifacts
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.rlib

# Compiled binaries with no extension
rust_out

# Node
node_modules/

# Images (test artifacts, screenshots, montages)
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.avif
*.jxl
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.tif
# Benchmark/report charts are intentional deliverables
!benchmarks/*.png
# v1 byte-identity golden-gate fixtures (tests/v1_golden_bytes.rs) -- tiny
# (<10KB combined), deterministic crops, load-bearing for the gate itself.
# Phase-4 finding (2026-07-19): these were referenced as "committed" in
# phase-3 commit messages/docs but the blanket `*.png` rule above silently
# excluded them the whole time -- `jj status` never showed them as new
# files, so nobody caught it until a fresh workspace came up with the test
# failing on a missing file, not a value mismatch. This carve-out is the
# fix; regenerate via `convert city.png -crop 96x96+200+150` (see
# `zensim/tests/v1_golden_bytes.rs`'s module doc) if ever lost again.
!zensim/tests/fixtures/v1_golden_real_*.png

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# Tooling noise
.superwork/
.claude/
copter-report/
.zenbench/
.external-cache/
Cargo.toml.original.txt
*.rs.local
*.profraw
*.profdata
fuzz-*.log

.workongoing
.workongoing.*
.session-log-*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Eval-harness per-pair output CSVs (large, regenerated on each eval)
benchmarks/*_per_pair.csv
benchmarks/*_per_pair_*.csv
benchmarks/v0_22_iw_v3_seed1_2026-05-17.bin
AGENT_COORDINATION_NOTE.md

# Benchmark output files generated at runtime (not source data)
**/font_results.json

# Standalone internal-tooling workspace roots (excluded from the root
# workspace) generate their own lockfiles; keep them out of the repo.
/zensim-bench/Cargo.lock
/zensim-picker-prep/Cargo.lock
/zensim-target/Cargo.lock
apidoc/target/

# workspace-local target symlink (CARGO_TARGET_DIR redirect)
/target
